<title>EGYPT: Egypt all-share index up 1.6 pct to record high.</title>
<headline>Egypt all-share index up 1.6 pct to record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index jumped 1.6 percent on Wednesday to close at a fourth straight record high of 352.08, from 346.58 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Capital Market Authority said turnover was a very high 142.27 million pounds ($41.8 million), most of it from partial privatisation of Misr Free Shops.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
